   "detailed_description": "<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/1739b48379575f31981de91c884bec3f.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=1446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/1739b48379575f31981de91c884bec3f.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/1739b48379575f31981de91c884bec3f.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打開「動物園之星 2：豪華版升級套件」深化你的保育願景，拓展影響力。內含來自全球的 6 種額外動物物種，以及精選專屬動物標誌，使你的園區更豐富。</p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >投入備受喜愛的動物園模擬遊戲續作《動物園之星 2》，打造更具野性的世界。盡情揮灑創意，在首次登場的全水生與飛行物種等各種驚人動物加持下，於世界各地建造並經營別具特色的動物園！此外，你可以更進一步投入動物保育，把你的動物野放到廣闊的可自訂野生動物保護區。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >令人驚嘆的動物 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索多樣化的動物物種陣容，每一種都有獨特的需求與行為。除了你熟悉喜愛的獅、西非黑猩猩等經典動物以外，還有許多新面孔將會加入，讓你以驚人的細緻程度打造獨特動物陣容。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建設美麗的動物棲息地，讓你的動物們在具備寫實互動特色的環境中茁壯成長，展現自然本能。從真實的群聚行為，到在你精心準備的植被中悠然覓食，盡顯自然風采。體驗動物的細節與高度沉浸感所帶來的世代躍進。令人驚嘆的自然動作與豐富情感，讓每隻動物前所未有地栩栩如生！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >驚奇水域 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >請準備好潛水裝備！全水生物種華麗登場，掀起水花四濺的精彩首秀！打造專屬的壯觀淡水或鹹水水族館，迎接令人興奮的可愛水生動物入住。水下的全新世界正等著你，繽紛魚群、汙翅真鯊、玳瑁等多樣的亮眼生物齊聚一堂！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >翱翔天際 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與鮮豔的大巨嘴鳥與威嚴的蛇鷲等多樣繽紛、光輝耀眼的全飛行鳥類一同翱翔高空！以圍欄、支撐柱和動態網狀覆蓋物建造完全可自訂的鳥舍，安置你的鳥類，讓牠們能夠自在又安全地飛翔。當牠們在獨特的棲息地中自由滑翔時，你也可以好好欣賞牠們在地面和天空中充滿生命力的動感姿態。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >野生動物保護區 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在動物園之外參與保育行動！加入全球保育計畫並達成特定條件，然後在世界各地親手打造出可完全自訂的廣闊野生動物保護區，便可將你的動物野放到其中，創造屬於你的生態系統。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >讓創意展翅高飛 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在多個橫跨全球的生物群落中，打造你夢想中的動物園。四種全新場景主題涵蓋世界各地的經典建築，結合自前作《動物園之星》回歸的五大主題，為你提供豐富的場景物件庫，讓你盡情建造與創作。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以輕鬆運用各式現成藍圖設計你的動物園，或發揮創意，利用《動物園之星》系列經典的逐件建造工具，把你無盡的創作巧思化為現實。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >透過縮放、彈性配色與便利的路徑系統，深入掌控每個細節，結合全新植被與地形筆刷，為你的動物園和野生動物保護區帶來大幅變革。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >意義重大的經營管理 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >為迷人的動物打造完美棲息地，吸引更多遊客，提升動物園評價並賺取資金，助你持續擴展園區。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在打造沉浸式空間的同時，管理動物園的日常運作，讓遊客在每個角落都能獲得充滿教育意義的體驗。透過多樣化的商店與設施滿足遊客需求，精心為他們規劃完美的出遊體驗。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >更具野性的世界正等著你探索 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入動物與生態系統網路 (FEN)，在生涯模式展開充滿樂趣的全球冒險。你可以在經典模式中建立全球的動物園與野生動物保護區網路，並與其他玩家交易動物，也可以透過沙盒模式盡情揮灑無限創意。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >緊密連結的社群 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 Frontier Workshop 發掘豐富多元的社群創作內容。你可以自由探索並下載各平台玩家所創作的藍圖與作品，或訂閱喜愛的內容，輕鬆地將其收入自己的動物園。  </p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >投入備受喜愛的動物園模擬遊戲續作《動物園之星 2》，打造更具野性的世界。盡情揮灑創意，在首次登場的全水生與飛行物種等各種驚人動物加持下，於世界各地建造並經營別具特色的動物園！此外，你可以更進一步投入動物保育，把你的動物野放到廣闊的可自訂野生動物保護區。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >令人驚嘆的動物 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/b0453c8c71e8e6bfd2ed60ca0a3b83a9.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索多樣化的動物物種陣容，每一種都有獨特的需求與行為。除了你熟悉喜愛的獅、西非黑猩猩等經典動物以外，還有許多新面孔將會加入，讓你以驚人的細緻程度打造獨特動物陣容。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建設美麗的動物棲息地，讓你的動物們在具備寫實互動特色的環境中茁壯成長，展現自然本能。從真實的群聚行為，到在你精心準備的植被中悠然覓食，盡顯自然風采。體驗動物的細節與高度沉浸感所帶來的世代躍進。令人驚嘆的自然動作與豐富情感，讓每隻動物前所未有地栩栩如生！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >驚奇水域 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/765f8c84e6d36b6f5b0e0c2d6e6aa561.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >請準備好潛水裝備！全水生物種華麗登場，掀起水花四濺的精彩首秀！打造專屬的壯觀淡水或鹹水水族館，迎接令人興奮的可愛水生動物入住。水下的全新世界正等著你，繽紛魚群、汙翅真鯊、玳瑁等多樣的亮眼生物齊聚一堂！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >翱翔天際 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/980e51a09a849dfcdfbbe85cb47f2811.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與鮮豔的大巨嘴鳥與威嚴的蛇鷲等多樣繽紛、光輝耀眼的全飛行鳥類一同翱翔高空！以圍欄、支撐柱和動態網狀覆蓋物建造完全可自訂的鳥舍，安置你的鳥類，讓牠們能夠自在又安全地飛翔。當牠們在獨特的棲息地中自由滑翔時，你也可以好好欣賞牠們在地面和天空中充滿生命力的動感姿態。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >野生動物保護區 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/759d31045fd079ed2ac2070deda0bea1.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在動物園之外參與保育行動！加入全球保育計畫並達成特定條件，然後在世界各地親手打造出可完全自訂的廣闊野生動物保護區，便可將你的動物野放到其中，創造屬於你的生態系統。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >讓創意展翅高飛 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/dea62c43eeb510bf549c76df336fc5e3.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在多個橫跨全球的生物群落中，打造你夢想中的動物園。四種全新場景主題涵蓋世界各地的經典建築，結合自前作《動物園之星》回歸的五大主題，為你提供豐富的場景物件庫，讓你盡情建造與創作。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以輕鬆運用各式現成藍圖設計你的動物園，或發揮創意，利用《動物園之星》系列經典的逐件建造工具，把你無盡的創作巧思化為現實。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >透過縮放、彈性配色與便利的路徑系統，深入掌控每個細節，結合全新植被與地形筆刷，為你的動物園和野生動物保護區帶來大幅變革。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >意義重大的經營管理 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/bd0e01cf4e9446a741b6f904b315b77a.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >為迷人的動物打造完美棲息地，吸引更多遊客，提升動物園評價並賺取資金，助你持續擴展園區。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在打造沉浸式空間的同時，管理動物園的日常運作，讓遊客在每個角落都能獲得充滿教育意義的體驗。透過多樣化的商店與設施滿足遊客需求，精心為他們規劃完美的出遊體驗。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >更具野性的世界正等著你探索 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7c2ff2aa747db3f8ad4a723591e98ac.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入動物與生態系統網路 (FEN)，在生涯模式展開充滿樂趣的全球冒險。你可以在經典模式中建立全球的動物園與野生動物保護區網路，並與其他玩家交易動物，也可以透過沙盒模式盡情揮灑無限創意。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >緊密連結的社群 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.poster.avif?t=1791984269\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.webm?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219030/extras/c7ad6c72bfa87c8dd07cbc232e7b8cdf.mp4?t=1791984269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 Frontier Workshop 發掘豐富多元的社群創作內容。你可以自由探索並下載各平台玩家所創作的藍圖與作品，或訂閱喜愛的內容，輕鬆地將其收入自己的動物園。  </p>",
   "short_description": "在《動物園之星 2》中打造更具野性的世界。在全球各地創辦獨一無二的動物園，讓令人驚嘆的動物們齊聚一堂，包括全新登場的水生與飛行物種，並將你的經驗延伸至動物園之外，將動物野放到廣闊的野生動物保護區。",
